From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregor MacLennan <gmaclennan@awana.digital>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 19:20:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build,gyp: mobile flavor handling in gyp generators
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

gyp generator support for the ios flavor: make.py/ninja.py treat ios
like mac (xcode_emulation supplies Apple flags), plus the common.py /
xcode_emulation.py switches that keep simulator vs device SDK selection
working. Without these, gyp has no notion of an iOS make build at
all.

Co-authored-by: Jaime Bernardo <jaime@janeasystems.com>
Co-authored-by: Andre Staltz <andre@staltz.com>
Co-authored-by: Julia Samól <j.samol@papers.ch>
---
